  "name": "Create Veo 3.1 videos with Gemini and post to TikTok, Reels and Shorts with PostWire",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "335dde1c-0205-47c8-a043-fda79d073cc1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -633,
        -97
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 762,
        "content": "## Create Veo 3.1 videos and post them everywhere\nTurn ideas in Google Sheets into AI videos: Gemini writes the Veo 3.1 prompt and a caption per network, Veo renders an 8-second vertical clip, and PostWire posts it to TikTok, Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts and Facebook.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Every day at 9:00** takes the first idea marked ready in the sheet and marks it as generating.\n2. **Plan the video with Gemini** returns the Veo prompt and a caption for each network, plus the YouTube title.\n3. **Generate the clip with Veo 3.1** renders it in 9:16 and the file goes straight to a PostWire upload slot: no Drive, no public link.\n4. **Publish with PostWire** posts it to every network with its own text. The row is the idempotency key, so a retry never posts twice.\n5. The row gets the post links, or the exact fix plus a **Gmail** report when a network refused.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a free account at postwire.io, connect your networks and copy your API key. In n8n add a **Header Auth** credential (name `Authorization`, value `Bearer pw_live_\u2026`) and select it in the three PostWire nodes.\n2. Create a sheet with the columns idea, style, networks, status, posted_at, links and note, and mark ideas ready. Pick it in the four Sheets nodes.\n3. Add a Google Gemini credential. Veo needs billing enabled in Google AI Studio (about one dollar per 8-second Veo 3.1 Fast clip); the captions fit the free tier.\n4. Connect Gmail and put your address in **Email me the fix**.\n\n### Customize\nSwitch to Veo 3.1 (not Fast) for quality, or add linkedin in the networks column."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
